{
  "name": "dsh-shared-memory",
  "version": "1.11.0",
  "description": "【DSH-elysia】全局共享记忆：所有会话共用一份可读可改的 MEMORY.md，双硬盘分区镜像 + 历史快照 + 跨进程写锁。人设可对话调整；要求/指正/教训/方法/请求/会话/方法库/文档九个分区；按命中频率与重复强调在主文件与可检索归档间流动；关键词共现 + BM25 排序，质疑度驱动换方法与翻归档；上下文压缩后自动重读。另有自有技能库（SKILL.md 操作手册，可选 run.mjs 执行并带路径/超时/参数护栏）和表情包（用户自己导入图片，插件按文件名与标签自动分类情绪，并**根据对话内容在合适时机自动发送**合适的表情包来表达情绪）。还有**语音朗读**（可选，默认关闭，依赖本机 GPT-SoVITS 引擎）和**记忆包（Memory Packs）**：插件自带整份角色记忆与人设（packs/elysia），安装时由用户选择是否启用，装前自动备份、可卸载恢复，只写 identity/persona 两个分区。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./packs": "./lib/packs.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "bin": {
    "dsh-memory-pack": "scripts/install-pack.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/*.js",
    "dsh",
    "packs",
    "scripts/install-pack.mjs",
    "README.md",
    "AGENTS.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh-bundle",
    "memory",
    "shared-memory",
    "persona",
    "backup",
    "mirror",
    "bm25",
    "retrieval",
    "archive",
    "tiering",
    "skills",
    "stickers",
    "emoticons",
    "memory-pack",
    "persona-pack"
  ],
  "author": "1148462398-hub",
  "license": "MIT",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/1148462398-hub/dsh-shared-memory#readme",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/1148462398-hub/dsh-shared-memory.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/1148462398-hub/dsh-shared-memory/issues"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public",
    "tag": "latest"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./dsh/cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ]
    }
  }
}
